      "writtenOn": "2020-03-16T13:42:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should also check that the the addresses are in the same prefix. The easiest way to do this might be to check that new IpPrefix(serverAddress.toString()).equals(new IpPrefix(clientAddress.toString()), because IpPrefix will do the truncation for you.\n\nYou should also put these on the server side (Tethering.java, perhaps?), because a malicious app can easily craft and send to the tethering service a TetheringRequest that does not pass these checks. That doesn\u0027t need to be in this CL.",
